# Keep host build artifacts, generated evidence, caches, the git database and
# the local out/ snapshot tree out of every image build context. These are never
# source the images build from. In particular, a stale host
# infer-cpp/build/cpu-release/CMakeCache.txt (referencing the host source path
# /home/.../MASI-NIDS-vNext/infer-cpp) breaks the in-image cmake configure with
# "source does not match the source ... used to generate cache".
**/build
evidence
**/evidence
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/dist
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pyright
**/target
**/node_modules
**/output
**/.playwright-cli
.git
out

# Historical source snapshots are review material only. They are never inputs to
# a vNext OCI build, even when the Docker build context is the repository root.
legacy-reference
